    Bug 1988881 - Move alert debounce to the top of the functions. r=tobyp

    We should say that there is an active alert as soon as we establish that there isn't already one.
    If any async code slips in between we could end up with two alerts.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D265045

